SUMMARY:NetSec Policy Workshop: Great Power Politics and the Future of Alliances
DESCRIPTION:A NetSec Working Group 2 policy workshop on great power politics and the future of alliances\, convening scholars and policy practitioners to examine how alliance politics is evolving under intensifying great power competition\, and what the implications are for European security.\n\nAccommodation in Ankara and all meals are provided by Bilkent University and the Royal Danish Defence College. NetSec plans to reimburse accepted participants' travel costs through COST Action NetSec up to a maximum of €700 per participant\, pending a decision by NetSec's Management Committee.\n\nApplications close 15 August 2026. Full details and the application form: https://netsec-cost.eu/policy-workshop-2026.html
LOCATION:Bilkent University\, Ankara\, Türkiye
URL;VALUE=URI:https://netsec-cost.eu/policy-workshop-2026.html
CATEGORIES:Policy workshop,NetSec
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
